{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4f55c9fe7c06915234d72aa37a11723b5b57555898c49c2b46ebe2868943a3d5",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e16b41756a9285f9c642eba568b5f9704fcfa6445c1ed1934b0838a8d279d5f",
      "text": "没有不停的雨",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d77e1e10e7c8f1475f328695279629470bdf4c7caffcff3d5ea8793c129117c",
      "text": "虽有才能，却因古怪言行\n无法被人理解的厨师阿斯兰，\n被餐馆解雇后在雨中漫无目的地\n徘徊。而他为了避雨所选择的，\n是某家咖啡馆的门檐下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e16b41756a9285f9c642eba568b5f9704fcfa6445c1ed1934b0838a8d279d5f",
      "text": "没有不停的雨",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be9d6262fa7f0d88a6688af8732da44c6e529790e293fb14f93464dd4210e0c7",
      "text": "本年度国际烹饪大赛\n最优秀奖得主是……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b17ed23d4f7196046dd6398bd0023289045b800a3e917d003f79c63374710d2",
      "text": "料理界的伟大恶魔，\n阿斯兰·别西卜II世！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d178ea0a9af82c3e332db0182994e6e35ffbf36ef155edadcc05897f0ea871f",
      "text": "（呵呵呵……谁都得跪伏在吾之料理面前。\n此乃理所应当之事！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16aebdb2e635e0eafd20d0c6487cba5bb1a8115daecd5f82a60655d3c3265878",
      "text": "吾曾如此深信。然而……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06d2daa37b8ed0aba3ff859690cc824e60520a710f2f9f2b8d6ee6ba4148b86a",
      "text": "开什么玩笑！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba4399920dd1240fa3c97f84e5ea982b30ae48074fe15322e6a05731e11bf843",
      "text": "我管你是什么伟大的恶魔还是什么东西，\n你说的话根本莫名其妙！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6769518632e721e7703ab0a219d904da33ad6d0c5459290adef9e99978a614a1",
      "text": "你被开除了！滚出去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0748f332e4e8d114055d65684f8553f375a250c541d19511f41213895a13e3c4",
      "text": "……在这家店里，吾也未能被接纳吗。\n还真是诸事不顺啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:409194af98a2b060faedc1d4dc09e71770d6f23a228cf93e33301e5183e27988",
      "text": "不仅如此，竟还遭苍天之泪洗礼。\n这样下去撒旦会被淋湿的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a56ef5a092794609f12e5ad15a4d56d2ae172cd9481b35e394b5670c9f3fa3b5",
      "text": "能保全己身之所在……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92560e938ccf882e9c66615a88f200a0a4a02d7851a5f25f6c393593cbb13380",
      "text": "（嗯。那栋建筑的屋顶，似乎可作盾牌）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dcc3ab8903ad8d5686882cee981a1cc46064175f3f6ca6ef2de27ce0f370a8e",
      "text": "（暂且与撒旦一同恢复魔力吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f817cfd7fb9a5c19e50016d60fd97b5f152148d7fd4b26c2e805c771447fe41",
      "text": "天空仍未止息吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:398d8a3fc6afefcdc0e296ad690bb404d9a93379396878ffab637b84fd7c0c5d",
      "text": "（……自那之后）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf481c2570e3627ce4e49e050ee58e4476a521bbcc2cf70f715d3cff2ea91de",
      "text": "（作为厨师辗转了许多店，\n却立即被废弃契约……抑或甚至未能结契）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76aad288366783a2ad47f33f78212a1099be7e128cd8e79e3496255c46c14ae8",
      "text": "恶魔？供品？\n你在耍我吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8a699dd05c51dd326fcb434d5594c2fe1164b3eda13bdba87ccfb60ea5ec858",
      "text": "那个……我、我们店人手已经够了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e8f6d9e84e475742a483283282a45f7b1deffa2b4fb9daea1b5573a95e79b6d",
      "text": "（皆不能理解吾）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c6285a4fee7570e89233d9ad05150d1978335b345208bb24c15711a7a8fdada",
      "text": "（说来……吾与师尊邂逅之时，\n亦是如此受困于孤独之刻啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b18e4e27c6655d76ba67b082af089d2cba93210fee5c5999f1e07c975f43cb65",
      "text": "（……肚子好饿啊。\n得快点去买饭才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cffe870d4f174761e6aed442ffe0e2800c0066b1323751065ed2bd7e09f3ac3a",
      "text": "……？哇，好香的味道。\n是从这家餐厅传出来的……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe43fd106beab79fda346e93b0a89013e8c49e58621f12fd1e00a80407227fe1",
      "text": "汝在此处作甚，小家伙。\n……汝之名为何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4835aa8aa5667375db3c022fb831c357a315223c30a93dddbb78dda46fa58563",
      "text": "……\n太郎……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec9305c3e4888959690a16fde649502cb142058d5f2cd85df098609761f6de1a",
      "text": "（自那日起，吾便在师尊座下研习精制术）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b70eddebfe3b619b529d887d5d2a7fa081ee71581020f268df2c6a4dc7c9141",
      "text": "（其后又远赴他国精进魔力，待回归故土时，\n师尊却已不知所踪……师尊之店亦荡然无存）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:919e5778cf03f00690ca1e5b19b6655c8838f58dd6d4efd61be6fa9ba37f98a9",
      "text": "难道吾之容身之处，\n已然无处可寻了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8862db5a38e0d75ed5414c7b0603fe9aa770a64dc6a3b8891f756fe9c7269584",
      "text": "吾今后究竟当如何……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bfc48a77291ee72af0571a34e387bf6a9c972b568328cfffab8eba200cfb428",
      "text": "你没事吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a351f775b34410907e94402da7a38308aaa3c6d1965a29a11d8707d2bc9bfcbc",
      "text": "唔！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c9a1d068231b2b99f4bb073f02122824a1dc41ef7a95a1a850044c1c162e877",
      "text": "都淋成落汤鸡了不是吗。\n呆在这种地方会感冒的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc2095c826989060aadeaf72ee5dd57315329b19c5df13fc34d7715e639ca6b2",
      "text": "不介意的话，请进里面避避雨吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f2e88f8d65367bade8e3643d51a2a389785f945801d6ba3793702ab10b26b67",
      "text": "吾、吾乃暗之使者！\n岂能轻易受人施舍……嗯？“里面”？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50266627b68604a9280cfe4ec8184f46af3fde97d58a102153e77e517dd3cd5f",
      "text": "是啊，别客气。请进！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_c:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32422daa9388d2963730340e0143b27d9385f0654c02a8a1f9f88c8ab509ec7e",
      "text": "欢迎光临Cafe Parade！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_d:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:076e81c5f9e1bc555babfd8d315221cee4991b5d11914c38b5454bc81cdbeb3d",
      "text": "Cafe Parade店内",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95645778092e84c64dd4e37bf8d7b0556e2b54f49a918daa99332b1b50325960",
      "text": "咖啡馆……？\n此处莫非是汝之领地？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e860523237f4ee953196f35739a653a70a4482cbd33bc6e06d084955dd38073",
      "text": "是的。\n不过现在是非营业时间，所以没有客人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26dad42f14271462c52dd788599b8d723ba887c7310d160600dd6fc978429949",
      "text": "我是店主神谷。\n啊，来，坐这儿吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9dd5748cd0306b9187f3637d89677d91c18e513f5f2e7c6882cf8407ab97320",
      "text": "外面很冷吧。\n来杯热红茶如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a51e5ad383b9ee8592930e03f88abafca8f31c7c98eadb36312de8b3e93f529",
      "text": "唔……确实湿透了。\n此番便承蒙汝之好意了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:009a8ba318f0e6b0fb5130751d697bb501c23b7a39e77135f51b9db12b12b47d",
      "text": "那么，我这就去泡。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bd61319504f2d87e3d8d0cec65ee151727be02e12a98a23af50842c6a53c370",
      "text": "承蒙诸多照料。\n伟大的堕天使撒旦亦深表感激。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0cc134a06e7fd6a74f06b5482681ace8e670f302a37a4c04a56bc54f53db31e",
      "text": "不客气。\n我马上就回来，请稍等片刻。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa4587fbf4da3f2de639bde39f47792eaddcc2053e880a367f959875d3125591",
      "text": "神谷。\n有客人来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b87ecbcace6441725fde5b6f47570aefe0a3fe31179e9d1377025cc6e68606df",
      "text": "啊啊。外面有个人没打伞被淋湿了呢。\n我就请他进来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b95c3fdf58ce31ecf96ed6f75d8322f949ef78cebe8afe983d291ac0f0baea0f",
      "text": "看着挺冷的，\n打算给他泡杯红茶。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e88a18f50c2cc2e67c790f2f0055a1ecad68d2c98f329c1ffad30bcbd42d3c93",
      "text": "那么，选哪种茶叶好呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8c2a047d18dadcbd457e541113841fa3bc6c9f3499b740f444e77aa62b20405",
      "text": "不介意的话，把这个也带上吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71bb2a34e8b2eb9e3cb7b5694d4fe6c0edf386eea0b5265f73cf475f8f488533",
      "text": "这是……巧克力的点心吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6385d93b098add1a81b059cd613f240ce29372ca46255f40306b7ffdc158508f",
      "text": "是的。新菜品的试作品。\n希望能合他的口味。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48a2f0f3f22963a2e2c31be30c2f253e94499d669d553500bd6a26467fee39b2",
      "text": "谢谢，我一起端过去。\n既然这样茶叶就……选这个吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b639918317b685c53dd5a444fe04d4877767495f7d52b7c490b1b8ec39fc40ab",
      "text": "那我送过去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10f4b390b945569a427c2cf74c920f1d5519e0319f187984cd7ef78619b1d337",
      "text": "（……真是的。你还是老样子呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8a4d9b531b72cd4658efa824cffa6883054306ebf39870c87156f6fe5c948aa",
      "text": "（一看到无处可去的人，\n马上就会捡回来）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_f:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01b6d1592572b1528ba8bf8c52667125c4fd56ba5f9e359e6a2d20fe82d40b95",
      "text": "久等了。\n请品尝本店的招牌。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_f:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13608cfcb8320eaddc284b970aaac6426aba10a150d505093e944f04ab70065d",
      "text": "哦哦……\n何等妙物，皆在绽放光辉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_f:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4e9993af0e7c965e8fec6242fc5aca791013c56f5f748f9c55e1ece25b1d74d",
      "text": "谢谢夸奖。\n趁红茶还没凉，请用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5ae7441e354426b63ee015bf7d22c74ca35e1abea5afa4998811707af431fed",
      "text": "实、实乃美味。而且，好温暖……\n眨眼之间便能精制出此等之物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_f:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf3c34558d96721ff97aa5975a9fae4f4e6d4ca18aa9959b1dea959f1a014a06",
      "text": "能合您的心意，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_f:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e207a178cc84890e07e517c50f1205f374c03b157ce75d0101293a8774baf07",
      "text": "（这些供品固然美妙，然此男子更是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_f:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:541f889407f13d1120863f3a54c2b014fb90389937778ea8db99ae0462cf1d0a",
      "text": "（不似他人，竟以毫无偏见之眼注视吾）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_f:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0583e8a8d6bd2b4a6de0a15b1a031541131ab6380110aeb54909d9189a7b996",
      "text": "（宛如……幼时指引吾之师尊一般）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_f:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de8a0ae19a8cdce330c9d6ccf194ee32ae1f096182bdc34684f88a2d066a62fb",
      "text": "（若是与此人同行，\n吾之魔力或许能得以倍增！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d4d9993235c3bd5b31412ada53874d05760c227bd61dea85587b3a92f099550",
      "text": "……此店，可已与主厨缔结契约？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_g:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fef37168141bb26e4d40235b755c1c71664424f0ad28f4bdfdcd1fd9ec7891d",
      "text": "主厨……吗？没有，现在只有兼任店主与\n侍者的我和一名西点师而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_g:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5815c90c9e4b87e1f35647691ce2e1beedd628fafb28e6d62beb07851828873",
      "text": "（何等侥幸！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_g:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59ce1a1519ed568d9117fdbdae16334f422861ad851d6a6d8fdc04227398a954",
      "text": "啊——哈哈哈哈！\n吾名为阿斯兰·别西卜II世！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_g:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15d5142cfeebe62ee2cce32362b06794a7bc1f9f24bf1419ca149d46d60525ca",
      "text": "乃堕天使撒旦之仆从，\n精制世间至深罪孽之供品之人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_g:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:104fb03ddcfaf9838693a522a89616b6a0f45bdf470447e75eb3af2980b24127",
      "text": "精制……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_g:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bdab959e8435e25ea7e3674db027d1c15be5d7bcadad0b3fce8a319a42c321a",
      "text": "名为神谷是吧。\n吾，欲与汝结契！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_g:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_g:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e18da7d53c9f002bc105128fcb04cae78ac36a12719e0fd4380a2fa9f2a0490",
      "text": "契约……呃，\n难道是想让我们雇佣你的意思吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_g:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:796406bd6c01e252c3f95093add9b850ed7fcb318dc4ff312a7ac7e0bc74d6e9",
      "text": "然也！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_g:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3fc125751d643c0fffc5440ad8084c80bd5b4d0e36f231d59e1ae11c7078397",
      "text": "这样啊。那……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_g:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c983c969ea2747df19751d22266a6f83b22162e12d7d6c1f4d883d3077f84c84",
      "text": "神谷，到底发生什么事了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_h:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05d698424aaaf6ca38cbdda5ebda7b1260b31e82cbdc413e2ae5631d18144f23",
      "text": "原来如此……你想在这里工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_h:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e91ccf6100edff482251c873b9ad66f3dc34c8ce0f3ccdf5697a5a251584a77e",
      "text": "嗯。\n正是如此。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a7715d6300372ad0322f2083ba04a18f2c9e03007f074303d4a270e00b132a8",
      "text": "然后，神谷你也想这么做。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_h:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9c33ea73ce35100651e2f37d56422ee4fdf705b6d0034cfa2f5d243631df484",
      "text": "是啊。我们店里没有主厨，\n有他在的话能帮大忙呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_h:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a421e6f1f4d8a3af46332e445048ee03645fcb1ce2fdd4dceaa82d4bbe5c705f",
      "text": "……真是的，你真是个大好人呢。\n底细不明的人，哪能这么轻易就雇佣……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_h:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9be1c20acb56c6513fd6108d462bde79a4e273a51497eef606f6a9fd836c03f6",
      "text": "话是这么说没错啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0baad3219377a11f6d1e098529443fd551ebf42e07fe236c7c93a0f575f7da23",
      "text": "总觉得，他跟我们挺像的呢。\n放不下不管啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_h:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_h:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2a634902891c7797e4fdf7ecfb078f6b71203a06f78cff36a26ff5316e0db6a",
      "text": "（我和神谷原本也是无处容身之人。\n心情我懂，但是）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97abbbb51dd958dacf2ae242d9d804331c06c19176410fa5f7cea31d2167c990",
      "text": "（我也是协助打理这家店的人。\n不能漫不经心地答应）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_h:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5599083bf091aaa6ae549cca53a21989045c81d042016c5d8e9c139927a49830",
      "text": "请问您叫什么名字？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_i:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a231e6256593da4ea148b96a24daf389af6dbb04f8bb16fb5047804425e9620",
      "text": "吾、吾名为阿斯兰·别西卜II世。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_i:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:174536c9dabf176d4236be8a3ab608a10254b5baf49d1478d60a94bbb3fcf5ab",
      "text": "II世……不对，是阿斯兰先生对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_i:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff0c070f251dbc45eec27040b6e87013f79953e9d5160cdaeeb121c8ce0e4d55",
      "text": "然也！镇坐于肩上者，\n乃背负世间万般罪恶之堕天使撒旦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_i:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78dbb12dd628a7070453c418c67dbd15e97bb011476774140f79f6bfc923d69f",
      "text": "阿斯兰先生，\n是希望作为主厨被雇佣对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_i:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd38e2f5ca240752e571597f9c15b3d6e48000765cdfac3dc04729a4ea5aaf94",
      "text": "唔、嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc9cd50414c79a64d26e60f281eeee05a795f369abfc0e77250dc0d6c47294c3",
      "text": "既然如此，作为测试，\n能做点什么给我们尝尝吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_i:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d993cb531272be30ad95d46a1d5f50368883a80c29f6c09de26ff9d5156c0cc2",
      "text": "嚯。汝竟欲对身为暗之眷属的吾，施以试炼吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:741b36aae5176e474348fb40e1125d50904e4a1febbec058530d79baf460ae33",
      "text": "哎。你愿意考虑他的事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e842b0bfe0c9ffbadb108b37f94b4575d0e9c87f260314b45022c9580036a917",
      "text": "是啊，嘛，虽然情况不太明了，\n但也不能对有困难的人置之不理吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_i:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:967b9e6dd05dd36911307568514b05d678eaaecf95915042931d129e37065e08",
      "text": "那么，阿斯兰先生。\n厨房在这边，请进。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca0357e82a2792f2e6df4d9b10c23cef263399f2e5d0ab4e6c31f5d65792b379",
      "text": "……哈哈，什么嘛，东云。\n你自己不也是个大好人嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fac20b64025d974115fa636f458781bc61e98fdc803c243b8ee3ecfc881c35d1",
      "text": "……真让人吃惊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_j:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1561770d857830373180d8253a015507381643114b55fb37e035cedfe7136033",
      "text": "烹饪手法固然利落，\n味道居然也达到了这种水准。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_j:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95778d75446be98a516130e756565e35c740b81f9a139c6c01e9b8478a438d6d",
      "text": "东云，这已经……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f003eca672cf1e90853d9cc624155ff846f8586f331ccd7c77b547c1c49131e7",
      "text": "（真是的。神谷可能捡到了一个\n不得了的人呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8e553e7da482686506cbfe246ddc772336946ebd42504535b3b1af84a243f0d",
      "text": "阿斯兰先生，你合格了。\n今后就请多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e189d5f3b0577c768eb8cac7e7dd2c6ceed901b9da03e3692fd3913c80f1fe2",
      "text": "太好……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_j:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb9cd056f27e8193822da31509f4b28a4f605baa40d50155f8789f73723866ff",
      "text": "唔、嗯！\n身为暗之眷属的吾，便借汝等一臂之力吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_j:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac8e1e8144efa9de21bd392d38916b69420b1fb2405391b0d07a8ffd7925d72a",
      "text": "我这边今后也拜托你了哦。阿斯兰。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_j:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fbcde8cb75446149506fd949f76a3388f110fcf0d313b5895a8f9e4f55a4b30",
      "text": "然也！\n呵、呵呵呵……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_j:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:777488f9d482ff42a3133a72fd3793fd0543398c1d5a1180a704f92d0145dc42",
      "text": "啊——哈哈哈哈！撒旦啊！\n自此时此刻起，吾等之霸道将翻开崭新一页……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_j:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8498bbbb1b4e6a0a0cb7833a966bca0036cbdfb33be3489984b843bc9292e88b",
      "text": "请安静。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_j:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:645c3295745fa09dac4d18dff9be8852f50ff95a6346f87c9aac623a9402eb79",
      "text": "料理方面虽然很倚仗你，\n但在客人面前请不要做出这种言行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_j:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2d9cff622a5d9f83a525d263e1379ccf82d084217d0be197736f8b7eaa7b519",
      "text": "可不能给别人添麻烦哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_j:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:209197354e9ae668c782a62dd6f4c7e59eeb0c5ddab41e9ddf3b2c0116eaa793",
      "text": "好、好的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_j:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:841bce7b4224b062a5df5c72c87563bc98b6c6db0cc560509fdc7c2addff216f",
      "text": "哈哈！\n看来今后会变得更加热闹了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
